{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographers' private lives (摄影师私生活).\n\nThe task requires selecting exactly 20 distinct candidates from the working set.\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates have titles with patterns like:\n- \"X：Y中的市场观察\" (market observation) - these are about camera purchase packages, promotions, celebrity endorsements - these match the \"器材促销\" (equipment promotion) that the user explicitly does NOT want.\n- \"X：Y中的专题观察\" (special topic observation) - about photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biographies, artwork circulation - these relate to \"摄影师私生活\" (photographer private life) / art history which user doesn't want.\n- \"X：Y中的概念速览\" (concept overview) - lists common concepts, provides question catalog for further reading.\n- \"X：Y中的条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - explains from light, imaging, visual relationships, variable effects, applicability conditions, analyzes when common intuitions fail.\n- \"X：Y中的操作记录\" (operation records) - fixes composition and light, changes shooting parameters, records corresponding images, compares highlights/shadows/subject details.\n\nThe user's interest explicitly states: 关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整 (focus on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions), 不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活 (not interested in equipment promotions or photographer private lives).\n\nSo the relevant content types are:\n- \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - matches imaging principles and adjustments under different conditions\n- \"操作记录\" (operation records) - matches actual shooting methods\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - provides concepts for further reading, somewhat relevant\n\nThe content types to AVOID:\n- \"市场观察\" (market observation) - equipment promotions, celebrity endorsements - explicitly excluded\n- \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) - exhibition curation, author biographies, artwork circulation - relates to photographer private life / art history - explicitly excluded\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. I need to select 20.\n\nLet me identify the relevant candidates (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览).\n\nLet me go through the list and categorize. Given the large number of candidates, let me identify the ones matching the user's interest.\n\nThe user wants actual shooting methods, imaging principles, adjustments under different conditions. The best matches are \"条件与原理\" and \"操作记录\" articles. \"概念速览\" provides concept overviews which are also relevant to learning.\n\nLet me collect all candidates that are NOT \"市场观察\" and NOT \"专题观察\".\n\nLet me scan through:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d - 静物布光：低照度室内中的市场观察 - MARKET - EXCLUDE\n2. item-03a565217024 - 运动追焦：窗边自然光中的专题观察 - TOPIC - EXCLUDE\n3. item-03b7af37b88f - 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e - 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n5. item-061d97575247 - 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3 - 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n7. item-07bfbf16235d - 微距景深：低照度室内中的市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n8. item-090691086c5b - 夜景曝光：低照度室内中的市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0 - 微距景深：黄昏户外中的概念速览 - INCLUDE\n10. item-0a19145321ef - 街头构图：窗边自然光中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n11. item-0b78ff27e538 - 微距景深：阴天街道中的市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n12. item-0ca34ef0a880 - 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的概念速览 - INCLUDE\n13. item-10d5a61a7f0a - 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的操作记录 - INCLUDE\n14. item-11c4e3cb9cf2 - 街头构图：黄昏户外中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n15. item-11d6f8fe3226 - 街头构图：低照度室内中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n16. item-12a571ccfc9e - 逆光人像：阴天街道中的操作记录 - INCLUDE\n17. item-143c3c5732d6 - 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n18. item-16a7440356e6 - 静物布光：窗边自然光中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n19. item-1a2494e4589c - 逆光人像：阴天街道中的条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n20. item-1b824b8d4dec - 风光滤镜：低照度室内中的概念速览 - INCLUDE\n21. item-1b9b39a7ef86 - 儿童抓拍：阴天街道中的概念速览 - INCLUDE\