y matches actual shooting methods\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - provides concepts, less directly about methods/principles but still learning-oriented\n\nI should prioritize \"条件与原理\" and \"操作记录\" articles, and balance across topics and conditions.\n\nLet me think about balance. The topics (subjects) are:\n- 静物布光 (still life lighting)\n- 运动追焦 (sports tracking focus)\n- 逆光人像 (backlit portrait)\n- 雨天反光 (rainy reflection)\n- 夜景曝光 (night exposure)\n- 室内白平衡 (indoor white balance)\n- 微距景深 (macro depth of field)\n- 街头构图 (street composition)\n- 风光滤镜 (landscape filter)\n- 儿童抓拍 (children candid)\n\nConditions (backgrounds):\n- 低照度室内 (low-light indoor)\n- 窗边自然光 (window natural light)\n- 黄昏户外 (dusk outdoor)\n- 阴天街道 (overcast street)\n\nI need to select 20 candidates. Let me prioritize the \"条件与原理\" and \"操作记录\" types which best match the user's interest in actual shooting methods and imaging principles.\n\nLet me count how many \"条件与原理\" and \"操作记录\" candidates there are.\n\n条件与原理 (conditions and principles):\n- item-03b7af37b88f 逆光人像：黄昏户外\n- item-04f2ff24ab7e 雨天反光：窗边自然光\n- item-061d97575247 夜景曝光：阴天街道\n- item-1a2494e4589c 逆光人像：阴天街道\n- item-2130f01f2f2c 风光滤镜：低照度室内\n- item-287bd2a75b9a 雨天反光：低照度室内\n- item-28b65f550fe1 微距景深：黄昏户外\n- item-2c0456eef787 夜景曝光：窗边自然光\n- item-2cbc282bedc9 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外\n- item-305dca4b57c4 静物布光：低照度室内\n- item-3ed55ed7b588 雨天反光：阴天街道\n- item-4ef7a9b648bc 夜景曝光：黄昏户外\n- item-5483802ef951 室内白平衡：窗边自然光\n- item-598ec31e514b 儿童抓拍：阴天街道\n- item-5c7e77e24c87 风光滤镜：窗边自然光\n- item-6602f232e957 雨天反光：黄昏户外\n- item-6d5b1bdb4843 逆光人像：窗边自然光\n- item-707e06945b80 逆光人像：低照度室内\n- item-7d209764a808 微距景深：阴天街道\n- item-8c818d43203a 儿童抓拍：低照度室内\n- item-9df219efa583 街头构图：窗边自然光\n\nThat's 21 条件与原理 candidates.\n\n操作记录 (operation records):\n- item-10d5a61a7f0a 雨天反光：窗边自然光\n- item-12a571ccfc9e 逆光人像：阴天街道\n- item-225af9fad31a 室内白平衡：阴天街道\n- item-2589e00e0e34 微距景深：低照度室内\n- item-2591e5ddcc17 微距景深：窗边自然光\n- item-274920178d43 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外\n- item-30b99cdb0a88 静物布光：阴天街道\n- item-3741cf536903 夜景曝光：阴天街道\n- item-38